nt shot, character settles into a neutral stance, lowering the weapon slightly, focus shifting from barrel to eyes.\n- 8-10s (P09): Low-angle extreme close-up, character blows the smoke off the barrel, steady expression, final定格 (freeze frame).\n\nAudio:\n- Diegetic sounds: Sharp, thunderous flintlock pistol reports, metallic mechanical clicking of the lock, heavy fabric flapping, wind whistling through the desert, dry earth crunching under boots.\n- Non-diegetic music: Intense, rhythmic percussive western score with a lone, gritty electric guitar riff.\n\nDo Not Include:\n- Do not include multiple characters or enemies.\n- Do not allow the character's facial features or clothing to change.\n- Do not allow the pistol to deform, bend, or modernize.\n- Do not include random camera rolls or shaky cam that obscures the action.\n- Do not include text, subtitles, or UI elements.\n- Do not include morphing limbs or clipping through the cloak."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 150, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [282], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [290, 330], "pos": [-585.701904296875, 5649.38232421875], "widgets_values": ["1d57947f61495247971880a72f8372a3423c94ac968d7862c8c8c3226012c5ab.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "id": 139, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.1", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_con